I've highlighted the minor part of your problem here.  Magicbane is a
crap close combat weapon compared to a tanked up Mjollnir or Excalibur
or Tsurugi of Muramasa.

The major part of your problem is that fighting ';' in melee is
pointless and foolish; see below.

>YASD, no doubt. I should have been more careful, but that made me
